    <string name="nlic_auto_consent">N-LIC will directly connect to addresses in your subscription to measure TCP latency. No actual VPN session will start. Continue?</string>
    <string name="nlic_auto_results">LIC-Auto · TCP results</string>
    <string name="nlic_auto_ineligible">This endpoint did not pass both TCP tests or uses UDP. It was not selected.</string>
    <string name="nlic_bay_label">LIC-Bay · VPN connection protection</string>
    <string name="nlic_bay_phase">Planned: route only the VPN outer TCP transport through ByeDPI SOCKS. Not enabled yet; UDP needs a separate design.</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_preview_warning">LIC-Core PREVIEW: this APK includes experimental sing-box. It uses the existing Android VPN/HEV path. Compatibility issues are possible. LIC-Bay is optional and cannot guarantee censorship bypass.</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_toggle">LIC-Core · connect via subscription</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_missing">This standard APK does not include libbox. Install the separate Core Preview APK. Legacy ByeDPI is unchanged.</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_requires_vpn">Select VPN mode, not Proxy, in the main N-LIC settings.</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_choose_supported">Select a supported VLESS, VMess, Trojan, Shadowsocks, HY2 or TUIC server first.</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_reconnect">Changes apply on the next connection. Reconnect VPN manually.</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_bay_toggle">LIC-Bay · protect VPN uplink with ByeDPI</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_bay_desc">Uses local ByeDPI SOCKS only for the VPN server uplink TCP transport. Disable LIC-Bay if the connection fails.</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_bay_udp">ByeDPI TCP packet methods do not apply to Hysteria2/TUIC. Select a TCP server.</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_profile_check">LIC-Core configuration check</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_profile_ready">Parameters compile to sing-box JSON. The actual VPN connection has not been validated.</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_profile_unsupported">No selected server or its settings are unsupported. Connection is disabled.</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_auto_toggle">LIC-Auto · automatically select working VPN</string>
    <string name="nlic_core_auto_desc">In LIC-Core mode, sing-box tests up to 12 encrypted VPN outbounds using HTTPS, selects a lower-latency working server and checks again every 10 minutes without interrupting existing connections. Requires Core Preview.</string>
