    <string name="nlic_ui_help">How to connect</string>
    <string name="nlic_ui_help_steps">1. In the main N-LIC settings, choose VPN mode.\n2. Import your HTTPS subscription or paste vless://, trojan:// or other connection links.\n3. Select a server below.\n4. Tap Connect and approve the Android VPN prompt.\n5. Once connected, try LIC-Auto. Enable LIC-Bay for TCP servers only if necessary.\n\nThis is experimental software. Check your connection, DNS and IPv6 yourself; leak protection is not guaranteed.</string>
